  "title": "Garlic Bread Grilled Cheese",
  "description": "This garlic bread grilled cheese recipe sandwiches three types of cheese — Pecorino Romano, provolone, and mozzarella — between buttery garlic bread.",
  "authors": [
    "Kimberly Holland"
